@MyRealAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Listar el catálogo
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Consultar un producto
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Producto inexistente: debe responder 404
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Abrir una factura
POST {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerDocument":"PRUEBA-001","customerName":"Cliente de prueba"}

### Usar el id devuelto al abrir la factura
@receiptId = 1
GET {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/receipts/{{receiptId}}

### Cierre sin detalles: 409
POST {{MyRealAPI_HostAddress}}/api/receipts/{{receiptId}}/close
